# skills: Flora's Water Bind (paralysis on one enemy, 9 MP, a 70 percent roll), its refusal, and its MP.
# Jian and Flora (party_flora), Flora at level 16 (level index 15 pinned), her MP NOT pinned (18 at the
# start), the random state set to 24 as each effect starts so the roll succeeds. Round 1: Jian Fights;
# Flora's Special list (wb_list on Water Bind, the fourth entry), the enemy grid, Down to front-row
# battler 9 and A: she casts in her spell pose and the ribbon of water coils round the enemy (wb_a to
# wb_t), MP 18 -> 9, status9 0 -> 4. Round 2: the grid's name bar reads "Par" for it (wb_tag); A is
# refused with "No effect!" (wb_refused), no MP taken; Left to battler 8 (the back-row enemy that
# dropped into the empty front slot) and A: MP 9 -> 0, status8 -> 4. Round 3: Water Bind is greyed in the list and A on it is refused for lack of MP (wb_no_mp).
# Battle records at 0x0228E860 (0x6C each: status in the low nibble of +0x08, HP +0x14, MP +0x18). Run with --save.
include party_flora
pin u32 0x020b4778 15
execpoke 0x020503A0 u32 0x020A0238 24
wait 270
peek u32 0x020B8620 records
watch u32 0x0228e8e4 flora_mp
watch u8 0x0228ea18 status4
watch u8 0x0228ea84 status5
watch u8 0x0228eaf0 status6
watch u8 0x0228ebc8 status8
watch u8 0x0228ec34 status9
watch u8 0x0228eca0 status10
